{"title":"Career Roadmap · Clinical Research Coordinator","role":"Clinical Research Coordinator","summary":"A Clinical Research Coordinator (CRC) supports the planning, execution, documentation, and coordination of clinical research studies. The role connects research participants, investigators, hospitals, sponsors, CROs, laboratories, ethics committees, and study teams.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Neuroscience / Cognitive Science"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a Neuroscience/Cognitive Science graduate, a particularly strong specialization is neurology, psychiatry, neurodegenerative disease, cognitive disorders, neuroimaging, and CNS clinical trials."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical route:"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Neuroscience/Cognitive Science → Clinical Research Internship → Clinical Research Coordinator / Clinical Trial Coordinator → Senior CRC → Clinical Research Associate / Project Specialist → Clinical Project Manager"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Exact CRC eligibility varies by institution, sponsor, CRO, and study. Some clinical studies prefer or require a health-science/life-science degree plus relevant research experience or GCP training. Always verify the job-specific requirements."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons: 2026–2046","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Student / Research Intern"},{"text":"Neuroscience + research methodology"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Junior CRC / Clinical Research Assistant"},{"text":"Study coordination + documentation"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"Clinical Research Coordinator"},{"text":"Participant and site management"}],[{"text":"2033–2037"},{"text":"Senior CRC / Clinical Research Specialist"},{"text":"Complex/multi-site studies"}],[{"text":"2037–2042"},{"text":"Clinical Research Associate / Project Lead"},{"text":"Monitoring + trial management"}],[{"text":"2042–2046"},{"text":"Clinical Project Manager / Research Operations Manager"},{"text":"Strategic clinical research leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Neuroscience foundation"},{"text":"Biology, psychology, physiology, statistics"},{"text":"Research notes + basic project"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Clinical research foundation"},{"text":"Study design, ethics, biostatistics"},{"text":"Research-method project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Clinical-trial skills"},{"text":"GCP, documentation, data management"},{"text":"Clinical research internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Industry readiness"},{"text":"EDC, regulatory documents, participant coordination"},{"text":"Trial-related project + internship"}],[{"text":"Post-graduation"},{"text":"Specialization"},{"text":"CNS trials, clinical operations, clinical data"},{"text":"CRC experience + relevant certification"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Neuroscience Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a strong understanding of the human nervous system."},{"type":"h","text":"Core subjects"},{"type":"p","text":"Focus on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cell biology"},{"text":"Molecular biology"},{"text":"Human anatomy"},{"text":"Human physiology"},{"text":"Neuroanatomy"},{"text":"Neurophysiology"},{"text":"Cognitive psychology"},{"text":"Developmental neuroscience"},{"text":"Biochemistry"},{"text":"Basic statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Neuroscience topics"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neurons"},{"text":"Synapses"},{"text":"Neurotransmitters"},{"text":"Action potentials"},{"text":"Brain regions"},{"text":"Sensory systems"},{"text":"Motor systems"},{"text":"Learning and memory"},{"text":"Attention"},{"text":"Emotion"},{"text":"Executive function"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Learn Clinical Research"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should now understand how a scientific hypothesis becomes a clinical study."},{"type":"h","text":"Study design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Observational studies"},{"text":"Cross-sectional studies"},{"text":"Cohort studies"},{"text":"Case-control studies"},{"text":"Randomized controlled trials"},{"text":"Blinded studies"},{"text":"Parallel-group studies"},{"text":"Crossover studies"},{"text":"Pilot studies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical-trial phases"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Phase I"},{"text":"Phase II"},{"text":"Phase III"},{"text":"Phase IV"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Know what each phase is designed to investigate rather than simply memorizing the labels."}]},{"heading":"Clinical Research Ethics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Informed consent"},{"text":"Participant rights"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Risk-benefit assessment"},{"text":"Vulnerable populations"},{"text":"Ethics committee/IRB review"},{"text":"Research misconduct"},{"text":"Data integrity"},{"text":"Participant safety"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For neuroscience research, special attention may be needed for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cognitive impairment"},{"text":"Psychiatric populations"},{"text":"Pediatric participants"},{"text":"Participants with impaired decision-making capacity"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Become Clinical-Trial Ready","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn the complete clinical-trial lifecycle."},{"type":"h","text":"Before the study"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Protocol"},{"text":"Investigator brochure"},{"text":"Informed consent form"},{"text":"Case report forms"},{"text":"Site selection"},{"text":"Ethics approval"},{"text":"Regulatory submissions"},{"text":"Site initiation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"During the study"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn about:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Participant recruitment"},{"text":"Screening"},{"text":"Enrollment"},{"text":"Visit scheduling"},{"text":"Protocol compliance"},{"text":"Adverse-event documentation"},{"text":"Source documentation"},{"text":"Data entry"},{"text":"Query resolution"},{"text":"Study-product accountability"}]},{"type":"h","text":"After the study"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Database lock"},{"text":"Study close-out"},{"text":"Document archiving"},{"text":"Final reporting"},{"text":"Trial records"}]}]},{"heading":"Good Clinical Practice","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Good Clinical Practice (GCP) should be a major learning priority."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Participant protection"},{"text":"Protocol compliance"},{"text":"Investigator responsibilities"},{"text":"Sponsor responsibilities"},{"text":"Essential documents"},{"text":"Source data"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Safety reporting"},{"text":"Data integrity"},{"text":"Quality management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A recognized GCP training certificate can strengthen an entry-level clinical research profile, but it does not by itself guarantee eligibility for a CRC position."}]},{"heading":"Neuroscience Clinical-Trial Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Example Areas","Strong Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Neurology"},{"text":"Stroke, epilepsy, multiple sclerosis"},{"text":"Neurology + trials"}],[{"text":"Neurodegeneration"},{"text":"Alzheimer's, Parkinson's"},{"text":"Cognitive assessment + trials"}],[{"text":"Psychiatry"},{"text":"Depression, anxiety, schizophrenia"},{"text":"Clinical assessment + research"}],[{"text":"Cognitive Disorders"},{"text":"Dementia, MCI"},{"text":"Neuropsychology + assessment"}],[{"text":"Neuroimaging"},{"text":"MRI, PET"},{"text":"Imaging + clinical data"}],[{"text":"Neuropharmacology"},{"text":"CNS drugs"},{"text":"Pharmacology + safety"}],[{"text":"Neurorehabilitation"},{"text":"Stroke, brain injury"},{"text":"Outcomes + rehabilitation research"}],[{"text":"Pediatric Neuroscience"},{"text":"Developmental disorders"},{"text":"Pediatric research"}],[{"text":"Digital Neurology"},{"text":"Digital biomarkers, wearables"},{"text":"Data + clinical research"}],[{"text":"Neurotechnology"},{"text":"BCI, neurodevices"},{"text":"Biomedical technology"}]]}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Prioritize internships with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospitals"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neurology departments"},{"text":"Psychiatry departments"},{"text":"Neurosurgery departments"},{"text":"Clinical research units"},{"text":"Academic medical centers"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CROs"},{"type":"p","text":"Explore roles involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical operations"},{"text":"Clinical data"},{"text":"Trial coordination"},{"text":"Regulatory documentation"},{"text":"Safety/pharmacovigilance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research institutions"},{"type":"p","text":"Look for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neuroscience laboratories"},{"text":"Cognitive research laboratories"},{"text":"Clinical research centers"},{"text":"Neuroimaging research groups"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Research Intern"},{"text":"Clinical Research Assistant"},{"text":"Clinical Trial Intern"},{"text":"Research Coordinator Intern"},{"text":"Clinical Data Intern"},{"text":"Neuroscience Research Intern"},{"text":"Clinical Operations Intern"},{"text":"Regulatory Affairs Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"Strong Internship Project","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"note","label":"Project","text":"CNS Clinical Trial Coordination Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete simulated clinical-trial workflow."},{"type":"h","text":"Study concept"},{"type":"p","text":"For example:"},{"type":"p","text":"A hypothetical randomized controlled study evaluating an intervention for mild cognitive impairment."},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Study synopsis"},{"text":"Research question"},{"text":"Inclusion criteria"},{"text":"Exclusion criteria"},{"text":"Study visits"},{"text":"Participant schedule"},{"text":"Informed-consent workflow"},{"text":"Case report form"},{"text":"Adverse-event log"},{"text":"Participant tracking sheet"},{"text":"Data-quality checklist"},{"text":"Study close-out checklist"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Clearly label it as a simulation, not an actual clinical trial."},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates practical understanding of trial coordination."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Highest-priority areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Good Clinical Practice"},{"text":"Clinical trial methodology"},{"text":"Clinical research operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research ethics"},{"text":"Informed consent"},{"text":"Safety reporting"},{"text":"Essential documents"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"R or Python"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Statistical testing"},{"text":"Data visualization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project management"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Task tracking"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Timelines"},{"text":"Meeting coordination"},{"text":"Documentation"}]}]},{"heading":"Clinical Research Technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with the concepts behind:"},{"type":"h","text":"EDC"},{"type":"p","text":"Electronic Data Capture systems are used to collect and manage clinical-study data."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data entry"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Queries"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Audit trails"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CTMS"},{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Trial Management Systems support:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site tracking"},{"text":"Study milestones"},{"text":"Enrollment"},{"text":"Monitoring"},{"text":"Trial operations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"eTMF"},{"type":"p","text":"Electronic Trial Master File systems organize essential trial documentation."},{"type":"p","text":"You do not need to master every commercial platform as a student. Understanding the workflow is the priority."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential entry-level positions include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Research Coordinator"},{"text":"Clinical Research Assistant"},{"text":"Clinical Trial Coordinator"},{"text":"Clinical Research Associate Trainee"},{"text":"Clinical Operations Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Data Coordinator"},{"text":"Clinical Data Associate"},{"text":"Clinical Research Data Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Neuroscience Research Assistant"},{"text":"Clinical Research Assistant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Regulatory"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulatory Affairs Assistant"},{"text":"Clinical Regulatory Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Safety"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pharmacovigilance Associate"},{"text":"Drug Safety Associate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Exact eligibility varies considerably, especially for pharmacovigilance and clinical roles."}]},{"heading":"Employer Interview Questions","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is a clinical trial?"},{"text":"What are Phase I–IV trials?"},{"text":"What is randomization?"},{"text":"What is blinding?"},{"text":"What is a placebo?"},{"text":"What is Good Clinical Practice?"},{"text":"What is informed consent?"},{"text":"What is a protocol deviation?"},{"text":"What is an adverse event?"},{"text":"What is a serious adverse event?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What are source documents?"},{"text":"What is a case report form?"},{"text":"Why is accurate documentation important?"},{"text":"What is an audit trail?"},{"text":"How would you handle missing data?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Coordination"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you manage a participant who misses a study visit?"},{"text":"How would you handle a protocol deviation?"},{"text":"How would you coordinate multiple participants?"},{"text":"How would you resolve a data query?"},{"text":"How would you maintain participant confidentiality?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Science route"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential options:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Neuroscience"},{"text":"M.Sc. Cognitive Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Neurobiology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biomedical Science"},{"text":"M.Sc. Life Sciences"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biotechnology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Clinical Research"},{"text":"M.Sc. Clinical Psychology (eligibility varies; this is not automatically a clinical-practice qualification)"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical research route"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc.","Clinical Research Experience","M.Sc./PG qualification in Clinical Research","Clinical Operations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Management route"},{"type":"p","text":"After gaining experience:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc.","Clinical Research","MBA Healthcare/Pharma Management"]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical Operations Manager"},{"text":"Clinical Project Manager"},{"text":"Healthcare Operations Manager"},{"text":"Research Program Manager"}]}]},{"heading":"Clinical Research + Biostatistics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A powerful combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Neuroscience","Clinical Research","Statistics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Probability"},{"text":"Descriptive statistics"},{"text":"Hypothesis testing"},{"text":"Confidence intervals"},{"text":"Regression"},{"text":"Survival analysis basics"},{"text":"Sample-size concepts"},{"text":"Statistical interpretation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Tools:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"R"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"SPSS"},{"text":"SAS concepts"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For advanced clinical data roles, SAS/R + biostatistics can significantly strengthen the profile."}]},{"heading":"Government / Public Research Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential environments include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government hospitals"},{"text":"Medical colleges"},{"text":"Public-health research institutions"},{"text":"Universities"},{"text":"Neuroscience research centers"},{"text":"Government-funded clinical research projects"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Research Assistant"},{"text":"Project Assistant"},{"text":"Clinical Research Coordinator"},{"text":"Project Coordinator"},{"text":"Research Associate"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility depends on the individual project advertisement and funding agency requirements."}]},{"heading":"Study Abroad","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Potential postgraduate fields:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neuroscience"},{"text":"Cognitive Neuroscience"},{"text":"Clinical Research"},{"text":"Clinical Trials"},{"text":"Clinical Investigation"},{"text":"Translational Medicine"},{"text":"Neuropsychology"},{"text":"Biomedical Sciences"},{"text":"Bioinformatics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Countries worth researching:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"Ireland"},{"text":"Singapore"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For clinical research programs, prioritize universities with strong relationships with teaching hospitals, clinical research centers, CROs, and pharmaceutical/biotechnology companies."}]},{"heading":"Clinical Research Associate Route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One of the strongest long-term transitions is:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research Associate (CRA)"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior CRA"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Trial Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Project Manager"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Operations Director"},{"type":"p","text":"A CRC develops valuable experience in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Site coordination"},{"text":"Participant management"},{"text":"Protocol compliance"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Data queries"},{"text":"Study timelines"}]},{"type":"p","text":"These skills can support movement into broader clinical operations roles."}]},{"heading":"Neuroscience + Digital Health","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Future clinical research will increasingly use:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wearable sensors"},{"text":"Smartphone-based assessments"},{"text":"Digital biomarkers"},{"text":"Remote patient monitoring"},{"text":"Telemedicine"},{"text":"Electronic patient-reported outcomes"},{"text":"AI-based cognitive assessment"},{"text":"Neuroimaging analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Neuroscience/Cognitive Science graduate should therefore consider learning:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Digital biomarkers"},{"text":"Basic machine learning"},{"text":"Clinical data standards"},{"text":"Digital-health workflows"}]}]},{"heading":"Neuroscience + AI","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"AI is becoming important in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Neuroimaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MRI analysis"},{"text":"PET analysis"},{"text":"Brain segmentation"},{"text":"Disease classification"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Cognitive assessment"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Speech analysis"},{"text":"Behavioral data"},{"text":"Digital cognitive tests"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical trials"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Patient recruitment"},{"text":"Trial matching"},{"text":"Risk prediction"},{"text":"Data quality"},{"text":"Endpoint analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Drug development"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Biomarker discovery"},{"text":"Patient stratification"},{"text":"Trial optimization"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A useful student project could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-based cognitive assessment analysis"},{"type":"flow","items":["Dataset","preprocessing","feature extraction","model","validation","interpretation"]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not present an academic AI model as a clinically validated diagnostic or medical device unless it has actually undergone the required validation and regulatory pathway."}]},{"heading":"Research Ethics and Participant Protection","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is especially important for a CRC."},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a strong understanding of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Participant autonomy"},{"text":"Informed consent"},{"text":"Confidentiality"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Risk minimization"},{"text":"Vulnerable participants"},{"text":"Ethics review"},{"text":"Protocol compliance"},{"text":"Safety reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For neuroscience studies involving cognitive impairment, the ability to understand consent capacity and appropriate participant safeguards is particularly important."}]},{"heading":"2040–2046 Evolution","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Clinical Research Coordinators will increasingly work with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Decentralized trials"},{"type":"p","text":"More study procedures may happen remotely."},{"type":"h","text":"Digital biomarkers"},{"type":"p","text":"Wearables and smartphones can generate continuous research data."},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted trial operations"},{"type":"p","text":"AI can help with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"Protocol-risk detection"},{"text":"Scheduling"},{"text":"Trial monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Precision clinical trials"},{"type":"p","text":"Patients may be selected based on:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Genetics"},{"text":"Biomarkers"},{"text":"Imaging"},{"text":"Disease subtype"},{"text":"Digital phenotypes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Neurotechnology trials"},{"type":"p","text":"Growth areas may include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brain-computer interfaces"},{"text":"Neuroprosthetics"},{"text":"Neuromodulation"},{"text":"Digital therapeutics"},{"text":"Neuroimaging technologies"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"h","text":"Neuroscience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Neuroanatomy"},{"text":"Neurophysiology"},{"text":"Cognitive neuroscience"},{"text":"Neuropsychology fundamentals"},{"text":"Neurological disorders"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Clinical-trial design"},{"text":"Protocols"},{"text":"GCP"},{"text":"Informed consent"},{"text":"Participant coordination"},{"text":"Adverse-event concepts"},{"text":"Protocol deviations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Documentation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Source documents"},{"text":"CRFs"},{"text":"SOPs"},{"text":"Essential documents"},{"text":"Data queries"},{"text":"Trial documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"R/Python"},{"text":"Clinical data concepts"},{"text":"EDC concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Participant interaction"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Organization"},{"text":"Time management"},{"text":"Problem-solving"},{"text":"Team coordination"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry proof"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"GCP training"},{"text":"1–2 clinical research internships"},{"text":"1 simulated clinical-trial project"},{"text":"1 neuroscience research project"},{"text":"Strong Excel/statistics skills"},{"text":"Clinical research portfolio"},{"text":"Relevant postgraduate study if targeting advanced roles"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Neuroscience + biology foundation","Year 2: Research methodology + statistics + ethics","Year 3: GCP + clinical-trial workflow + documentation","Year 4: Clinical research internship + EDC/data skills","Graduate: Clinical Research Coordinator / Research Assistant","2–5 years: Senior CRC / Clinical Research Specialist","5–10 years: CRA / Clinical Trial Lead / Project Specialist","10–20 years: Clinical Project Manager / Clinical Operations Manager / Research Operations Leader"],"label":"Year 1"},{"type":"h","text":"Best profile by graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"B.Sc. Neuroscience/Cognitive Science + strong neuroscience foundation + GCP knowledge + clinical research methodology + participant coordination + trial documentation + biostatistics + Excel/R/Python + clinical research internship + one complete simulated trial project."},{"type":"p","text":"This profile keeps multiple pathways open across clinical trials, neuroscience research, CROs, pharmaceutical companies, hospitals, clinical data, regulatory operations, and emerging digital-neurology research."},{"type":"p","text":"909 | UG | Science | B.Sc (General / Honours) | Immunology / Virology / Industrial Microbiology | Immunology Technician"}]}]}